List</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/28/womens-basketball-walton-named-to-cheryl-miller-award-watch-list</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/28/womens-basketball-walton-named-to-cheryl-miller-award-watch-list</guid><category>Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Zaza Walton during preseason practice" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg" /><br /><br />SPRINGFIELD, MASS. — The Naismith Basketball Hall of Fame announced the 20 watch-list candidates for the 2027 Julius Erving Award and, in partnership with the Women's Basketball Coaches Association (WBCA), the 20 watch-list candidates for the 2027 Cheryl Miller Award. The annual Julius Erving Award, named after the Class of 1993 Hall of Famer and 17-year professional basketball player, celebrates its 13th year by recognizing the top small forward in NCAA Division I men's college basketball. The Cheryl Miller Award, in its 10th year, honors the top small forward in NCAA Division I women's college basketball. It is named after the three-time Naismith Player of the Year and Class of 1995 Hall of Famer.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg"><media:title>Zaza Walton during preseason practice</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59599</s:story_id></item><item><title>Smith Earns Big 12 Starting Seven Honors</title